  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1 Packaging and documentation fixes, no code changes. The package ships the licence as LICENSE.md, and the README describes the Community License on its current terms. Row expansion is documented as \"row detail\" so it is not mistaken for nested master/detail grids. Blazor Server is listed in the package tags, as it is supported. Bundles apex-grid 3.3.0 with strongly-typed callbacks for all 29 grid events.",
